IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-COALESCE-V9.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HYPERCUBE-DIM       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SHARD-CAP-KB        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONCURRENT-TENANTS  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-COALESCE-V9.
    IF HYPERCUBE-DIM == 0 OR SHARD-CAP-KB == 0 OR CONCURRENT-TENANTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 36800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 HYPERCUBE-DIM.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
